 SECOND FOOT, ORCHID ELEPHANTS.","cipher":null},{"seq":766,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1636,"retries":0},{"seq":767,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Orchid is at F2 (Middle Ford) and threatening our central position. I must reinforce it while maintaining doctrine. Rhino camp units are strong. I will move my foot to F2, using cipher to avoid detection. I will use a decoy to screen my main move."},{"seq":768,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c248","house":"rhino","letter":"L302","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, IMQND TK IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":769,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1715,"retries":0},{"seq":770,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Doctrine: Speed wins, plain orders by road, horse hunts riders on N bank, take E ford early and hold. Kite forces are concentrated at F3 (East Ford). I need to reinforce F3 and apply pressure. Sending archers/cav/inf to F3. The Tiger camp has a captured message mentioning my forc"},{"seq":771,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c249","house":"kite","letter":"L303","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":772,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c250","house":"kite","letter":"L304","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4500,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":773,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c251","house":"kite","letter":"L305","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":774,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1871,"retries":0},{"seq":775,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino truce is active. I should exploit this to secure fords or attack a vulnerable enemy.\nMy archers at s-east can engage kite/tiger presence at F3/s-east. Rhino infantry at F2 is a target. I will use decoys as per doctrine."},{"seq":776,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c252","house":"orchid","letter":"L306","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":4800,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK JKQTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":777,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c253","house":"orchid","letter":"L307","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2"],"depart":4800,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":778,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c254","house":"orchid","letter":"L308","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-ferry","s-east"],"depart":4500,"plain":"BOWMEN, ATTACK AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":779,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c255","house":"orchid","letter":"L309","kind":"decoy","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":780,"t":4500,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1909,"retries":0},{"seq":781,"t":4500,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Rhino is pressing F2 heavily (4w ago reports). Orchid is also active near F2/S-Mid. Kite has strong presence at F3. I should reinforce F2 to counter Rhino/Orchid, while using cavalry to screen/harass kite units near F3."},{"seq":782,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c256","house":"tiger","letter":"L310","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":783,"t":4500,"type":"courier","id":"c257","house":"tiger","letter":"L311","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH